============================  基础类型与控制环境  ========================================
NREL_5MW_OC4_Semisub 模型


============================  基础类型与控制环境  ========================================
          1   PCMode - 变桨模式 {0=不采用控制器; 1=外部 Bladed DLL 控制器}
"./TUBCon_1.3.9_64Bit.dll"     DLL_FileName - Name/location of the Bladed DLL
"./TUBCon_Params_V1.3.9_NREL5MW.xml"    DLL_InFile - Name of input file sent to the DLL (-) [used only with Bladed Interface, may be .in or .xml]
"DISCON"      DLL_ProcName - Name of procedure in DLL to be called (-) [case sensitive; used only with DLL Interface]


